5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’d like to start by understanding the actual scope of this year’s development allocation before we discuss any specific programs.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,Scope is irrelevant if the outcome is invisible. I want to know what our previous initiatives actually achieved before we commit more resources.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I’m concerned about how any new program will affect the existing rosters. I’d like to see the staffing records to understand where the pressure really sits.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I’m worried about whether the hospital can physically absorb another program. I need to check the rooms, parking, and shuttle coverage first.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I’ve seen too many good ideas crumble in the second year. I want to check the board minutes on that jointly run clinic to see where it went wrong.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, I hear you, but we must also know what we can afford. Let’s look at the ledger and the readmission figures together.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, the ledger is just numbers. I need the readmission figures to prove the call-back trial actually worked before we waste more money.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, the physical space is vital, but the people filling it matter more. I need to see the therapy and midwifery staffing review to understand our actual capacity.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, I agree people are key, but I still need to see the booking system records to know if we can even schedule the extra visits.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, I appreciate your focus on the people, but I need to see the visit completion records to understand why our shared rounds failed before.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, I understand your skepticism, but the ledger shows our allocation is down by nearly a quarter. We must know the financial reality before debating past successes.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, the ledger is just a constraint. I need the readmission figures to prove the call-back trial actually worked before we waste more money.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
